"All read on October 2, 2026. The links lead to the French pages that were "
"read; most of these sites also offer an English version."
msgstr "Toutes lues le 2 octobre 2026."

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid ""
"Also tell Revenu Québec and the Canada Revenue Agency, Canada Post if your "
"mail is diverted, and your service providers (CAI, Canadian Anti-Fraud "
"Centre)."
msgstr ""
"Avisez aussi Revenu Québec et l'Agence du revenu du Canada, Postes Canada si"
" votre courrier est détourné, et vos fournisseurs de services (CAI, Centre "
"antifraude du Canada)."

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.view_credit_reminder_form
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.view_credit_reminder_search
msgid "Archived"
msgstr "Archivé"

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid ""
"Ask unknown creditors to close the accounts you did not open (Service "
"Canada)."
msgstr ""
"Demandez aux créanciers inconnus de fermer les comptes que vous n'avez pas "
"ouverts (Service Canada)."

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid ""
"At least once a year, and each time something looks suspicious: a bill for a"
" service you never asked for, a collection agency calling about an unknown "
"debt, a lender mentioning credit you never requested (AMF, CAI, FCAC). Your "
"reminders alternate the two bureaus every six months."
msgstr ""
"Au moins une fois par année, et chaque fois que quelque chose semble suspect"
" : une facture pour un service jamais demandé, une agence de recouvrement "
"qui réclame une dette inconnue, un prêteur qui parle d'un crédit que vous "
"n'avez pas demandé (AMF, CAI, ACFC). Vos rappels alternent les deux agences "
"tous les six mois."

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_credit_identity.field_bf_credit_reminder__message_attachment_count
msgid "Attachment Count"
msgstr "Nombre de pièces jointes"

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_credit_identity.selection__bf_credit_reminder__kind__statements
msgid "Bank and credit card statements"
msgstr "Relevés bancaires et de cartes de crédit"

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid ""
"Be wary of opened envelopes and of statements that stop arriving (Service "
"Canada)."
msgstr ""
"Méfiez-vous des enveloppes ouvertes et des relevés qui n'arrivent plus "
"(Service Canada)."

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_credit_identity.selection__bf_credit_reminder__bureau__both
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_credit_identity.selection__bf_credit_setup__alert_bureau__both
