msgstr "Agence"

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid "CAI: Personal information leak or identity theft"
msgstr "CAI : Fuite de renseignements personnels ou vol d'identité"

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid ""
"Call your financial institutions and card issuers; close compromised "
"accounts and ask for a warning note on your accounts (CAI, Canadian Anti-"
"Fraud Centre)."
msgstr ""
"Appelez vos institutions financières et émetteurs de cartes ; fermez les "
"comptes compromis et demandez une note d'avertissement à vos comptes (CAI, "
"Centre antifraude du Canada)."

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid "Canadian Anti-Fraud Centre: Fraud victim (modified October 30, 2025)"
msgstr ""
"Centre antifraude du Canada : Victime de fraude (modifiée le 30 octobre "
"2025)"

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.view_credit_setup_form
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuler"

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid ""
"Change your passwords, from another device if the fraudster had access to "
"yours (AMF)."
msgstr ""
"Changez vos mots de passe, depuis un autre appareil si le fraudeur a eu "
"accès au vôtre (AMF)."

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid "Checking your own file or score has no effect on your score (FCAC)."
msgstr ""
"Consulter votre propre dossier ou votre cote n'a aucun effet sur votre cote "
"(ACFC)."

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid "Commission d'accès à l'information (CAI): Credit file"
msgstr "Commission d'accès à l'information (CAI) : Dossier de crédit"

#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
