#. module: bf_credit_identity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_credit_identity.credit_guide_content
msgid ""
"Credit monitoring services from the bureaus are paid and do not include the "
"security alert (AMF). After a breach, ask whether your bank, credit union or"
" insurer offers monitoring for free (AMF)."
msgstr ""
"Les services de surveillance du crédit des agences sont payants et "
"n'incluent pas l'alerte de sécurité (AMF). Après une fuite, demandez si "
"votre banque, votre caisse ou votre assureur offre la surveillance "
"gratuitement (AMF)."

